Licensing
=========

This repository contains two kinds of material under two different licenses.

1. Code

   All source code, scripts, configuration and documentation in this repository
   are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
   Full text: CODE-LICENSE
   SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

2. Model derivatives

   Fine-tuned weights derived from the Liquid AI LFM2.5 base models, and any
   files shipped with them (for example decider_config.json), are licensed under
   the LFM Open License v1.0.
   Full text: MODEL-LICENSE

   Note: the LFM Open License v1.0 is not an OSI open-source license. It limits
   commercial use above a revenue threshold and requires redistributing the
   license text with the model.

Base models
-----------

The LFM2.5 base weights are downloaded from Hugging Face
(LiquidAI/LFM2.5-2.6B-Base, -1.2B-Base, -350M-Base, -230M-Base) and are not
redistributed as part of this repository's code. Their license travels with
them; the copy used is MODEL-LICENSE.

Third-party code
----------------

This project ports and adapts code from Mapika/decider, which is Apache-2.0.
Its attribution is retained in NOTICE.
